# Cloudflare static redirects (read from the root of what is published; public/ is copied into
# dist/ verbatim). Both hosts apply this file: Pages, and Workers Static Assets for every path the
# Worker does not run first (wrangler.jsonc gives it /guide-assets/* only). Matched top to bottom,
# first match wins, and they run before the SPA fallback and without invoking any user code.
#
# The standalone User Guide (US-119) lived at /guide/ (Vietnamese) and /guide/en/ (English) until
# it moved into the app at /user-guide/<lang>/<chapter>. Old bookmarks and shared links land on the
# same chapter in the same edition: the chapter slugs are the old file names, the app strips a
# trailing `.html` and maps `index` to the start chapter, and the browser keeps the #section across
# the redirect. Pinned by src/test/user-guide-redirects.test.ts.
#
# ORDER MATTERS: /guide/assets/*, /guide/en and /guide/en/* must stay ABOVE /guide/*, which would
# otherwise catch them first — sending English links to the Vietnamese edition and screenshots to
# a chapter that does not exist.
/guide/assets/*  /guide-assets/:splat  301
/guide/en        /user-guide/en         301
/guide/en/*      /user-guide/en/:splat  301
/guide           /user-guide/vi         301
/guide/*         /user-guide/vi/:splat  301
